      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:3:5:5",
      "text": [
        " سَمِعْتُ أَبَا عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) يَقُولُ إِذَا وُجِدَ الرَّجُلُ وَ الْمَرْأَةُ فِي لِحَافٍ وَاحِدٍ جُلِدَا مِائَةَ جَلْدَةٍ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Abu Ali Al Ashary, from Muhammad Bin Abdul Jabbar, from Safwan Bin Yahya, from Abdul Rahman Al Haza who said, ",
          "‘I heard Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> saying: ‘When the man and the woman are found to be in one quilt, they would both be whipped a hundred lashes’."
        ]
      }
